<title>USA: JPE Inc acquires brake parts company.</title>
<headline>JPE Inc acquires brake parts company.</headline>
<dateline>ANN ARBOR, Mich. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>JPE Inc on Thursday said it acquired Brake, Axle and Tandem Co.</p>
<p>The Dallas-based company provides truck and trailer brake hardware, wheel-attaching and suspension parts.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not dislosed.</p>
<p>JPE shares were unchanged at 7-1/2 Thursday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
